WEBVTT

00:16:00.497 --> 00:16:03.333
Čuo sam da mu taj mišić otkazuje

00:16:03.375 --> 00:16:06.086
i većina stvari koje je u to vrijeme kucao

00:16:06.086 --> 00:16:07.796
nisu imale nikakvog smisla.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.717
Odjednom smo čuli pištanje,

00:16:11.758 --> 00:16:14.094
bip bip bip bip.

00:16:14.928 --> 00:16:16.054
Kucao je.

00:16:16.763 --> 00:16:21.727
Svi smo se približili laptopu
da vidimo kuda se kursor kreće,

00:16:21.768 --> 00:16:24.813
i otišao je sve do slova V.

00:16:25.272 --> 00:16:27.232
A onda sljedeće slovo,

00:16:27.274 --> 00:16:28.984
bip bip bip.

00:16:29.317 --> 00:16:31.194
Do slova A